                 ✨ The PHP Framework for Modern Web Builders ✨
================================================================================
 Welcome to SqueHub v2.0.0. Your application source is ready to configure.
================================================================================

 🔧 CONFIGURE YOUR APPLICATION
    Windows PowerShell                 Copy-Item .example.env .env
    Linux / macOS                      cp .example.env .env
    Generate a private key             php squehub key:generate

    Paste the complete generated value into APP_KEY in .env. Then review
    APP_ENV, APP_DEBUG, database settings, and the services you intend to use.
    For a reviewable setup plan, run:  php squehub setup

 🚀 QUICK START
    Check installation                php squehub doctor
    List application routes           php squehub route:list
    Start development server          php squehub start
    List every CLI command            php squehub help

 🛠  GENERATE APPLICATION CODE
    Controller                        php squehub make:controller BlogController
    Model                             php squehub make:model Post
    Middleware                        php squehub make:middleware AuthMiddleware
    Migration                         php squehub make:migration create_posts
    Seeder                            php squehub make:seeder PostSeeder

 🗄  DATABASE AND SEEDERS
    Apply pending migrations          php squehub migrate
    Review migration status           php squehub migrate:status
    Roll back latest migration batch  php squehub migrate:rollback
    Run application seeders           php squehub seed
    List available seeders            php squehub seed:status
    Roll back a reversible seeder     php squehub seed:rollback PostSeeder

 📦 PACKAGES AND KITS
    Install Package from source       php squehub package:install <source>
    Inspect installed Packages        php squehub package:list
    Install Kit from local source     php squehub kit:install <source>
    Inspect installed Kits            php squehub kit:list

 🧰 UTILITIES
    Clear application cache           php squehub cache:clear
    Clear compiled Views              php squehub view:clear
    Inspect available commands        php squehub help

 📚 DOCUMENTATION
    Installation guide
      https://www.squehub.com/docs/v2.x/installation
    CLI reference
      https://www.squehub.com/docs/v2.x/cli
    Source repository
      https://github.com/squehub/squehub

 Build something useful. SqueHub will keep the framework and your Project/
 application code clearly separated as it grows.
================================================================================

MESSAGE
